      "content": "That makes sense, but I'm worried about that \"trade-off\" you mentioned regarding complexity and coordination. If we actually moved to a 50-node decentralized setup, do you think it would be possible to maintain our current 99.9% on-time delivery rate for critical medications? Give me a projection or a simulation of how the coordination overhead might impact our most sensitive delivery windows.",
